WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 9ba87f0c52699c431570792318049b06

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.109
Karibu tena. Natumaini sasa unaweza kutumia vitendakazi

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:07.870
na vitanzi vya repeat kwa kujiamini kabisa. Kwa hiyo katika

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.080
kipindi hiki, tutaendelea na mada nyingine muhimu

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.610
sana ambayo utaitumia katika

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.880
karibu kila programu utakayoandika, na

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:19.220
mada hiyo ni variable. Variable ndiyo kitu kinachotuwezesha

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:22.700
kuhifadhi taarifa. Tunapopanga programu, mara nyingi tunahitaji

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:25.420
kuhifadhi namba au string

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.780
ili kuitumia baadaye, na variable ndiyo njia

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.480
tunayotumia kufanya hivyo. Kwa hiyo hebu tuangalie kwa upana kidogo

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:32.880
ndani ya ghala la Jiki, na utaona kwamba ana

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:35.780
rafu nyingine. Tayari tunafahamu

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.160
rafu ya kwanza iliyo na

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.680
vitendakazi, mashine hizi ndogo kama move

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.140
na rectangle. Lakini kwenye rafu hii

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:44.710
ya pili, badala ya mashine, unaweza kuona masanduku

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:47.860
mengi, na masanduku haya ndiyo

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:50.080
tunayoyaita variable. Unaweza kumwambia Jiki ahifadhi

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:52.460
kitu chochote kwenye masanduku haya, na baadaye

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.940
umwombe atoe kitu hicho tena. Kila

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:57.480
sanduku lina jina, sawa kabisa na jinsi

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:00.020
vitendakazi vinavyokuwa na jina, na kila sanduku lina

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:03.000
kitu kimoja tu. Kwa sasa, ama namba

00:01:03.380 --> 00:01:05.320
au string. Lakini tutaangalia jinsi ya kuhifadhi

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:07.480
vitu tata zaidi humo, mbele zaidi kwenye

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:10.800
kozi. Kwa hiyo tunamwambiaje Jiki

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:12.500
atengeneze sanduku na kuweka kitu ndani yake?

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:16.920
Tunatumia keyword let. Keyword let

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.200
inamwambia Jiki kwamba anahitaji kutengeneza

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:21.860
sanduku jipya. Unaweza kumfikiria akifungua

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.760
sanduku la kadibodi kutoka kwenye kifungashio chake,

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:26.320
akilikamilisha, kisha anaangalia kinachofuata

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:28.840
baada ya neno let, na hiyo ndiyo lebo

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:30.620
anayoiweka kwenye sanduku, katika hali

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:32.940
hii, name. Kwa hiyo anatoa kalamu yake,

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:36.260
na anaandika name kwenye lebo. Kisha

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:38.360
anaangalia kinachofuata baada ya alama

00:01:38.440 --> 00:01:41.020
ya sawa. Katika hali hii, ni jina langu, Jeremy,

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:43.960
na kwa sababu Jeremy ni string, ndiyo, string,

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:45.640
anachukua karatasi, na

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.830
anaandika Jeremy juu yake. Ni string tu,

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:50.460
sawa kabisa na rangi ambazo umekuwa

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:52.660
ukizitumia, kisha anaweka karatasi

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:56.410
hiyo ndani ya sanduku. Kwa hiyo

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:58.260
tumemwambia atengeneze sanduku, aweke

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:00.120
lebo juu yake, na kuweka kitu ndani yake,

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.300
na sasa anaenda kuweka sanduku hilo

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:05.140
kwenye rafu. Na kisha wakati wowote

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.980
mwingine kwenye programu yako, Jiki anaweza kwenda

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.840
kuchukua sanduku hilo kutoka kwenye rafu, na kuangalia

00:02:09.979 --> 00:02:11.900
kilicho ndani yake, na tutalifikia hilo

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.580
baada ya muda mfupi. Lakini kwa sasa, ninataka sana

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:16.540
uanze kujenga modeli hii

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:19.120
ya kiakili. Nimekuwa nikipanga programu kwa muda mrefu sana, na bado,

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:21.790
ninapoandika msimbo, huwa najifikiria ninaweka

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.680
kitu kwenye sanduku, na kwamba

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:26.340
nitakitoa baadaye. Unapoona

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.570
keyword let hiyo, ninataka sana ufikiri,

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:31.460
"Sawa, hiyo inamaanisha ninatengeneza sanduku jipya."

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:34.530
Nataka tuzungumze kidogo

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:37.210
kuhusu majina ya variable, yaani lebo za

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:40.140
masanduku haya. Tuna sheria chache kuhusu

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:44.740
hizo. Kwanza, majina ya variable hayawezi kuwa na nafasi

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.580
ndani yake. Ikiwa unataka kutumia maneno mengi

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.859
kwa lebo ya sanduku, tunagandamanisha

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:51.900
maneno hayo, na

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:55.180
tunabadilisha herufi ya kwanza ya kila neno

00:02:55.220 --> 00:02:57.520
iwe herufi kubwa. Hii tunaiita camel

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:00.660
case. Fikiri nundu za ngamia zinazosukuma

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.540
juu herufi ya kwanza ya kila neno jipya

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:05.260
iwe herufi kubwa. Kwa hiyo ikiwa

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:08.290
unataka lebo ambayo ni jina langu, badala

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:10.920
ya kuandika maneno mawili yenye nafasi, tunaiandika

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.400
kama neno moja na N ikiwa herufi kubwa.

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.960
Pia, kila jina la variable lazima liwe la kipekee.

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:20.180
Huwezi kuwa na masanduku mawili yenye lebo moja,

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:23.180
na pia variable haziwezi kuwa na jina sawa

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:26.140
na vitendakazi. Ukisahau, Jiki

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.040
atachanganyikiwa na atakupa ujumbe wa hitilafu.

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:31.210
Sawa, basi hebu tuangalie mahali tunapoweza

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:34.160
kuhitaji kutumia variable. Tuseme

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.920
tunachora jua angani. Sasa,

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:39.490
tunajua tunaweza kutumia kitendakazi circle na

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:43.480
kukipa maingizo manne. Ni left, top, radius,

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:47.000
na color. Lakini tunapochora vitu

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:49.160
vingi na namba hizi zote zikitawanyika

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:51.740
kote kwenye msimbo wetu, inaweza kuwa vigumu sana

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:55.020
kuzifuatilia na kusoma. Kwa hiyo badala yake,

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:57.500
tunaweza kuunda variable kwa kila moja ya

00:03:57.600 --> 00:04:00.760
left, top, radius, na color, kisha kuzirejelea

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:04.560
variable hizo baadaye. Kwa hiyo lengo letu la mwisho

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:06.380
hapa ni kuweza kutumia

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:11.200
kitendakazi circle na kubainisha majina mazuri yanayosomeka ya

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:14.590
masanduku, na Jiki anapoona majina hayo,

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.480
atajua kuchukua masanduku kutoka kwenye rafu

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:20.459
na kutumia chochote kilicho ndani yake. Kwa hiyo hebu

00:04:20.519 --> 00:04:22.550
tuunde variable kadhaa kwa hivi. Tunaanza na

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:25.050
nafasi ya kushoto ya jua. Tuna...

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.350
eh, tunatumia keyword let

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:29.700
kumwambia Jiki atengeneze sanduku jipya linaloitwa

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:32.310
leftPosition. Angalia camel case hapo

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:35.180
na P kubwa. Na tunamwambia

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:38.560
Jiki ni namba gani inaingia kwenye sanduku. Anaiweka

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:40.340
kwenye rafu, kisha anaendelea

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:43.020
kufanya vivyo hivyo kwa topPosition, radius,

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:46.540
na color. Sasa, wakati wowote kwenye

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:48.870
msimbo wetu, tunaweza kurejelea variable hizi,

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.400
na Jiki atatoa thamani na

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:53.530
kuziweka kwenye mashine. Jambo lingine

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:56.120
zuri kuhusu variable ni kwamba wakati wowote

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.960
tunapotaka kuchora kitu katika nafasi ile ile

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.620
ya jua, tunaweza kutumia tena variable zile zile

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:04.980
za leftPosition na topPosition. Hebu tuchukue

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.660
mfano mwingine. Fikiri unajenga ukuta, na

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:10.200
una matofali 30, na unataka matofali

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:11.840
yote yawe na upana sawa na

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:14.270
urefu sawa. Ni bora zaidi

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:17.100
kuunda variable za upana na urefu

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:19.580
mwanzoni mwa msimbo wako, kisha

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:21.590
kuzirejelea katika msimbo wako wote

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:23.900
uliobaki. Kwa sababu ikiwa baadaye utataka

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:25.960
kubadilisha upana au urefu, unaweza

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.260
kuubadilisha mahali pamoja tu, na kila kitu

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:33.100
kingine kitabadilika. Katika mazoezi machache yajayo,

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:35.980
utatumia variable kuandika

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:38.840
msimbo safi na unaosomeka kwa urahisi zaidi. Na ukishazoea

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:41.910
kuunda na kutumia variable,

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:44.280
tutaangalia jinsi variable inavyoweza kurejelea variable

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.920
nyingine, na hapo ndipo mambo yanapokuwa na nguvu kweli kweli.

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:50.110
Lakini kwa sasa, nenda kajizoeze na mazoezi haya,

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:51.880
nami nitakuona tena hapa hivi karibuni.
